    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35717" root="قص" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقْصُوصٌ</span></b>  <i>Cut, clipped,</i> or <i>shorn;</i> applied to
hair [&amp;c.]; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصِيصٌ</span></b> : (M, TA:) and to a
wing; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُقَصَّصٌ</span></b> . (A.) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقْصُوصُ الخَنَاحِ</span>
A bird <i>having the wing clipped.</i> (S.) And
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُقَصَّصٌ</span></b>  <i>Having the forelocks clipped,</i> or <i>shorn.</i>
(Meyd, in Golius.)

